      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but the score is still a bit low for our coverage requirements. The script flagged a lot of missing granularity in the DPI and rate-limiting sections.\n\nCan you expand this? I really need to see a much more granular breakdown of the actual testing steps. Don't worry about making the individual points long—just break every sub-step, every single verification check, and every specific packet type into its own unique bullet point. The more bullets the better for the score, as long as they relate to the Sentinel-X specs.",
